{"kind":"note","note_type":"basic","fields":["This Pennsylvania-born trombonist played with some of the finest bands starting at age 16. In 1934 he and his brother formed their own band. Although they were successful, they separated in 1935 and formed separate bands. His biggest hits were Marie and Opus One.","Tommy Dorsey"],"tags_json":"[\"trivia\",\"music\",\"source:open-trivia-qa\",\"license:cc-by-sa-4.0\"]"}
